  "description": "Microsoft Teams alerting sink for SinkSharp. Posts Error/Critical log events to a Teams channel as an Adaptive Card via a channel Workflow webhook — today's supported way to post into a channel. Pair it with a per-sink minimum level so only what someone needs to see right now reaches the channel.",
