  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release\n• TeamsWebhookSink — posts an Adaptive Card to a Teams channel Workflow webhook, today's supported way to post into a channel\n• Card includes a level badge, the rendered message, a fact set (category/timestamp/correlation-id), and the exception as a monospace block\n• One retry with short back-off on a transient failure (configurable); never crashes the pipeline — failures surface through the pipeline's own sink-failure logging, same as every other sink\n• Short default HTTP timeout (5s) so a hung webhook call doesn't stall the event's sink fan-out\n• Bring your own HttpClient (e.g. from IHttpClientFactory) via TeamsWebhookSinkOptions.HttpClient\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/.github/blob/main/profile/CHANGELOG.md",
